{ "D3D12: the network runs on the game's own device, recorded into its command list\n(no second device, no copies through shared memory, no queue crossings).\nVulkan: the network runs on a Vulkan device of its own beside the game.\nAuto: D3D12 when the runtime's check on this GPU and driver passes, otherwise Vulkan.\nChanging it recreates OpenRR.", "D3D12: jaringan berjalan di device milik game sendiri, direkam ke command list-nya\n(tanpa device kedua, tanpa salinan lewat shared memory, tanpa lintas queue).\nVulkan: jaringan berjalan di device Vulkan sendiri di samping game.\nAuto: D3D12 kalau pemeriksaan runtime di GPU dan driver ini lolos, kalau tidak Vulkan.\nMengubahnya membuat ulang OpenRR." },
