{ "Experimental", "Eksperimental" },
{ "Experimental. Finds people in the frame on the CPU, in a process of its own, and with two or more\npasses keeps the first pass's result on them; the rest of the frame takes every pass. With one pass\nonly the strength and detail below act. Needs the person-model folder beside OptiScaler (models\nand ONNX Runtime). Where the mask is missing, late or the game's motion and depth are unusable, the\nframe keeps NR as it is. Off by default.", "Eksperimental. Mencari orang di frame lewat CPU, di proses tersendiri, dan dengan dua pass atau\nlebih mempertahankan hasil pass pertama pada mereka; sisa frame menerima semua pass. Dengan satu pass\nhanya kekuatan dan detail di bawah yang bekerja. Butuh folder person-model di samping OptiScaler (model\ndan ONNX Runtime). Kalau mask tidak ada, terlambat, atau motion dan depth game tidak bisa dipakai,\nframe tetap memakai NR apa adanya. Mati secara default." },
{ "Exponent on the floor filter's normal edge-stopping weight. Higher\nstops harder at creases and silhouettes; 0.0 disables the term.", "Eksponen pada bobot edge-stopping normal milik floor filter. Lebih tinggi\nberhenti lebih keras di lipatan dan siluet; 0.0 menonaktifkan term ini." },
