{ "Follow in-game", "Ikuti game" },
{ "Follows per-pixel agreement between the two paths instead of handing\nover every type-1 pixel equally. Whether RR damaged a pixel is a\nper-pixel fact, so one flat weight is the wrong instrument for it.\nWhere the two agree structurally the choice is moot and RR wins on\nstability; where they diverge, RR removed something the floor kept,\nwhich is the case the handover exists for. 0 is off.", "Mengikuti kecocokan per piksel antara kedua jalur, bukan menyerahkan\nsemua piksel type-1 secara sama rata. Apakah RR merusak sebuah piksel\nitu fakta per piksel, jadi satu bobot rata bukan alat yang tepat.\nDi tempat keduanya cocok secara struktur, pilihannya tak penting dan RR\nmenang di kestabilan; di tempat keduanya berbeda, RR membuang sesuatu\nyang dijaga floor, dan untuk kasus itulah handover ada. 0 berarti mati." },
{ "For NR pick mochizuki or lmxxf, or set [DlssNr] HostComputeBackend=HIP (no DLSS-FG),\nthen restart the game.", "Untuk NR pilih mochizuki atau lmxxf, atau set [DlssNr] HostComputeBackend=HIP (tanpa DLSS-FG),\nlalu restart game." },
{ "For fine tuning the depth cutoff\nShows UI and depth cutoff areas\nAdjust depth cutoff so that only stuff like your gun and hands are marked", "Untuk fine tuning cutoff depth\nMenampilkan area UI dan cutoff depth\nAtur cutoff depth supaya hanya hal seperti senjata dan tanganmu yang ditandai" },
{ "For games that change their render resolution as they run. Auto: once it drops\nbelow the game's colour buffer, one network, built for the largest resolution\nseen, serves every frame, which moves inside it; the network then costs that\nlargest resolution's time. Exact: the network is rebuilt for each resolution, a\nsecond or two without NR every time. Always: as Auto from the first frame, also\nwhen the game makes its buffers again at another size.", "Untuk game yang mengubah resolusi render saat berjalan. Auto: begitu turun\ndi bawah colour buffer game, satu jaringan, yang dibangun untuk resolusi terbesar\nyang pernah terlihat, melayani semua frame, yang bergerak di dalamnya; jaringan lalu\nmemakan waktu sebesar resolusi terbesar itu. Persis: jaringan dibangun ulang untuk tiap\nresolusi, satu-dua detik tanpa NR setiap kali. Selalu: seperti Auto sejak frame pertama,\njuga saat game membuat ulang buffer-nya dengan ukuran lain." },
{ "For inputs that use the 1080 tier: runs it on 1088 rows instead of 1152, about 4% faster.\nSlightly lossy, most at the bottom of the picture. Changing it rebuilds the model.\nThe new model always runs NVIDIA's 1152 rows.", "Untuk input yang memakai tier 1080: menjalankannya di 1088 baris, bukan 1152, lebih cepat sekitar 4%.\nSedikit lossy, paling terasa di bagian bawah gambar. Mengubahnya membangun ulang model.\nModel baru selalu menjalankan 1152 baris milik NVIDIA." },
