{ "Free and always free", "Gratis dan selamanya gratis" },
{ "Freezes the frame the model works on. While held, change paper white, the\nstrengths, the reversible mode, the model preset -- anything below the\nupscaler -- and only that setting moves; the scene does not.\n\nWhat it CANNOT show: DLSS/FSR/XeSS upscaler presets or anything upstream\n(the upscaler is not re-run on a held frame), and the game's own HUD and\npost-processing, which run after this pass and keep updating. The white\npoint stops being measured and holds its value while frozen, so it cannot\ndrift and confound the comparison.\n\nHide the menu and it stays held. Untoggle to resume.", "Membekukan frame yang dikerjakan model. Selama ditahan, ubah paper white,\nkekuatan, mode reversible, preset model -- apa pun di bawah\nupscaler -- dan hanya pengaturan itu yang bergerak; scene-nya tidak.\n\nYang TIDAK BISA ditampilkan: preset upscaler DLSS/FSR/XeSS atau apa pun di hulu\n(upscaler tidak dijalankan ulang pada frame yang ditahan), serta HUD dan\npost-processing milik game, yang berjalan setelah pass ini dan terus ter-update.\nTitik putih berhenti diukur dan nilainya ditahan selama dibekukan, jadi tidak\nbisa bergeser dan mengacaukan perbandingan.\n\nSembunyikan menu dan frame tetap ditahan. Matikan toggle-nya untuk lanjut." },
