{ "Keeps the mask in 0..1 before the network sees it (after the invert).\nSome games (Resident Evil Requiem) write values up to 3000, which DLSS-RR takes as they are\nand which leave trails and shimmering here. Only does something while the mask is in use.", "Menjaga mask tetap di 0..1 sebelum jaringan melihatnya (setelah invert).\nBeberapa game (Resident Evil Requiem) menulis nilai sampai 3000, yang diterima DLSS-RR apa adanya\ndan yang meninggalkan jejak dan shimmer di sini. Hanya berpengaruh selama mask dipakai." },
