{ "Leaves Streamline, Reflex and FG control to the game/external mod.\nNR and NGX upscaling remain available. Save Settings and restart.\nDoes not install an unlocker or enable FG in unsupported games.", "Menyerahkan kontrol Streamline, Reflex, dan FG ke game/mod eksternal.\nNR dan upscaling NGX tetap tersedia. Simpan pengaturan lalu restart.\nTidak memasang unlocker atau mengaktifkan FG di game yang tidak didukung." },
{ "Legacy", "Legacy" },
{ "Legacy: the network runs once for every pass, each on the last one's result.\nFast: the network runs once a frame and its change is pushed as far as the passes\nwould take it (Extrapolation), for about the cost of one pass.", "Legacy: jaringan berjalan sekali per pass, masing-masing di atas hasil sebelumnya.\nFast: jaringan berjalan sekali per frame dan perubahannya didorong sejauh yang\nakan dicapai pass (Ekstrapolasi), dengan biaya sekitar satu pass." },
