{ "Lets you override each preset's ratio individually\nNote that not every game supports every quality preset\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means internal resolution of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "Memungkinkan override rasio tiap preset satu per satu\nPerlu diingat, tidak semua game mendukung semua preset kualitas\n\n1.5x di layar 1080p berarti resolusi internal 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720" },
