{ "Linear (default)", "Linear (default)" },
{ "Linear hands the frame over unchanged, as danielblnc's own runtime does.\nsRGB and Gamma 2.2 decode it to linear light before the model and encode\nits answer back afterwards, which weakens the model's colour and lighting.\nSome games may still look better with one of them.", "Linear menyerahkan frame tanpa diubah, seperti runtime danielblnc sendiri.\nsRGB dan Gamma 2.2 men-decode-nya ke cahaya linear sebelum model dan meng-encode\njawabannya kembali sesudahnya, yang melemahkan warna dan pencahayaan model.\nBeberapa game mungkin tetap terlihat lebih bagus dengan salah satunya." },
