{ "NR without upscaling runs on the danielblnc and mochizuki runtimes. NrBackend\nis off, so this session runs no NR.", "NR tanpa upscaling berjalan di runtime danielblnc dan mochizuki. NrBackend\nmati, jadi sesi ini tidak menjalankan NR." },
{ "NR without upscaling runs on the danielblnc and mochizuki runtimes. lmxxf runs\ninside an upscaler call, so a game without one gets no NR.", "NR tanpa upscaling berjalan di runtime danielblnc dan mochizuki. lmxxf berjalan\ndi dalam panggilan upscaler, jadi game tanpa upscaler tidak mendapat NR." },
{ "NR without upscaling: optical flow, scene resets, fixed noise seed and depth when available. Includes the game's HUD. D3D9, D3D11, D3D12, Vulkan and OpenGL. RenoDX composition does not apply here.", "NR tanpa upscaling: optical flow, reset adegan, seed noise tetap, dan depth bila tersedia. Termasuk HUD game. D3D9, D3D11, D3D12, Vulkan, dan OpenGL. Komposisi RenoDX tidak berlaku di sini." },
{ "NR: %s", "NR: %s" },
{ "NVIDIA's internal automatic mask, not the colour-based preview below.\nWith Skin structure=-1 it follows general structure, so the difference may be subtle.\nTry Skin structure=0 versus Local structure=1 to compare. Mask accuracy is model-dependent.", "Mask otomatis internal NVIDIA, bukan pratinjau berbasis warna di bawah.\nDengan Struktur kulit=-1 ia mengikuti struktur umum, jadi bedanya bisa tipis.\nCoba Struktur kulit=0 lawan Struktur lokal=1 untuk membandingkan. Akurasi mask tergantung model." },
{ "Native resolution? You must be joking", "Resolusi native? Pasti bercanda" },
{ "Natural", "Natural" },
{ "Natural and Cinematic: the network's answer is graded afterwards, as NVIDIA's DLL\ndoes, so the two styles look apart. Off gives the picture they had before (little\ndifference in some games). Standard is not graded. No rebuild.", "Natural dan Sinematik: jawaban jaringan di-grade sesudahnya, seperti yang dilakukan DLL\nNVIDIA, jadi kedua gaya terlihat berbeda. Off memberi gambar yang mereka punya sebelumnya\n(sedikit bedanya di beberapa game). Standar tidak di-grade. Tanpa build ulang." },
