{ "Number of frames the FG is allowed to be ahead of the game\nMight prevent FG on/off switching, but also might cause issues", "Jumlah frame yang boleh didahului FG dari game\nMungkin mencegah FG on/off bergantian, tapi juga bisa menimbulkan masalah" },
