{ "Off", "Off" },
{ "Off (default): the model keeps its temporal history, building each frame\non the ones before it, which steadies the image. The upscaler accumulates\ntoo, so some ghosting is possible.\n\nOn: every frame is processed on its own, with no history. Less ghosting,\nmore flicker and shimmer. With the INI-only single slot (AmdSlots=1) the\nrender thread also waits for the model every frame.\n\nChanging it restarts the model's history.", "Off (default): model menyimpan riwayat temporalnya, membangun tiap frame\ndi atas frame-frame sebelumnya, yang menstabilkan gambar. Upscaler juga\nberakumulasi, jadi sedikit ghosting mungkin terjadi.\n\nOn: tiap frame diproses sendiri, tanpa riwayat. Ghosting lebih sedikit,\nflicker dan shimmer lebih banyak. Dengan slot tunggal khusus INI (AmdSlots=1)\nrender thread juga menunggu model di tiap frame.\n\nMengubahnya memulai ulang riwayat model." },
{ "Off (soft knee)", "Off (soft knee)" },
{ "Off for this session: %s.", "Off untuk sesi ini: %s." },
{ "Off preserves colour in selected pixels; lighting/detail can still change.\nAlso set Skin detail / lighting to 0 to suppress both.", "Off menjaga warna di piksel terpilih; pencahayaan/detail masih bisa berubah.\nAtur juga Detail / cahaya kulit ke 0 untuk meredam keduanya." },
{ "Off. The model stays loaded, so turning this back on is immediate.", "Off. Model tetap dimuat, jadi menyalakannya lagi langsung jadi." },
{ "Off: the new model of NVIDIA's 310.9.16 DLL (lmxxf 0.44's Small), about a third\nfaster, when native-game-tiled-assets\\small is installed (without it the old\none runs anyway), with any number of passes.\nOn: the 71-block model lmxxf ran before. Switching rebuilds the model.", "Off: model baru dari DLL 310.9.16 NVIDIA (Small dari lmxxf 0.44), sekitar sepertiga\nlebih cepat, bila native-game-tiled-assets\\small terpasang (tanpa itu model lama\ntetap yang jalan), dengan jumlah pass berapa pun.\nOn: model 71-blok yang dijalankan lmxxf sebelumnya. Menggantinya membangun ulang model." },
{ "Oh great, another potato PC", "Wah bagus, PC kentang lagi" },
{ "Old model", "Model lama" },
{ "On", "On" },
{ "On (default): danielblnc's runtime uses the same noise every frame. With a new\nnoise each frame, the model's temporal history shows it as flicker and\nshimmer under an upscaler. danielblnc 0.4.1 to 0.8.0.", "On (default): runtime danielblnc memakai noise yang sama di tiap frame. Dengan noise\nbaru tiap frame, riwayat temporal model menampilkannya sebagai flicker dan\nshimmer di bawah upscaler. danielblnc 0.4.1 sampai 0.8.0." },
{ "On the RX 6000: most of the network's products as 8-bit integer dot products\n(dlssnr-amd\\shaders-rdna2-int8), about a tenth faster than FP16. On by default. Off,\nor without that folder, the FP16 network runs (with ACO, when it is on above).\nSave Settings and start the game again to apply it.", "Di RX 6000: sebagian besar perkalian jaringan sebagai perkalian titik bilangan bulat 8-bit\n(dlssnr-amd\\shaders-rdna2-int8), sekitar sepersepuluh lebih cepat dari FP16. Aktif secara bawaan.\nSaat mati, atau tanpa folder itu, jaringan FP16 yang berjalan (dengan ACO, jika aktif di atas).\nSimpan pengaturan dan restart game supaya berlaku." },
{ "On the RX 6000: runs ACO's gfx10.3 machine code when dlssnr-amd\\aco-gfx103x is\ninstalled (experimental); without it, or with this off, the driver compiles the\nnetwork. Save Settings and start the game again to apply it.", "Di RX 6000: menjalankan kode mesin gfx10.3 ACO bila dlssnr-amd\\aco-gfx103x\nterpasang (eksperimental); tanpa itu, atau bila ini off, driver meng-compile\njaringan. Simpan pengaturan dan jalankan game lagi untuk menerapkannya." },
{ "On, the network's change comes back through the curve's bounded inverse. Off, as\nits ratio in the picture the network was shown. RenoDX stage, HDR frames.", "On, perubahan jaringan kembali lewat invers terbatas dari kurva. Off, sebagai\nrasionya pada gambar yang diperlihatkan ke jaringan. Tahap RenoDX, frame HDR." },
{ "On: New wait mode (1-pixel draw, runtime 0.3.1 or later). Still being tested.\nOff: Original wait mode (switches immediately).\nRestart if prompted: hooks or a pass may not be ready for new wait mode.\nFrames that cannot use new wait mode still fall back to original wait.", "On: mode tunggu baru (draw 1 piksel, runtime 0.3.1 atau lebih baru). Masih diuji.\nOff: mode tunggu asli (langsung berpindah).\nRestart jika diminta: hook atau pass mungkin belum siap untuk mode tunggu baru.\nFrame yang tidak bisa memakai mode tunggu baru tetap kembali ke tunggu asli." },
{ "One more stutter and I might lose it", "Satu stutter lagi dan saya bisa hilang kesabaran" },
{ "One pass: lower the strength or the detail for the protection to do anything.", "Satu pass: turunkan kekuatan atau detail supaya proteksinya berpengaruh." },
{ "One that only ever climbs is a counter, not an exposure.", "Yang cuma terus naik itu counter, bukan exposure." },
{ "Only FG", "Hanya FG" },
{ "Only FSR1 and Bicubic are supported when Ratio is below 1.0.", "Hanya FSR1 dan Bicubic yang didukung bila Rasio di bawah 1.0." },
{ "Only hook ntdll.dll methods\nDisable for switching back to kernel hooks", "Hanya hook method ntdll.dll\nNonaktifkan untuk kembali ke hook kernel" },
{ "Only limits the FPS", "Hanya membatasi FPS" },
{ "Only the chosen model runs. PP-HumanSeg (default) and YOLO11n-seg cover the whole body; YuNet\nkeeps a soft oval on each face it finds, so hair and clothes take every pass. Small, turned or\nhidden faces can be missed. CPU time per mask, measured on an 8-core desktop CPU: about 6 ms,\n40 ms and 2 ms. A change restarts the model.", "Hanya model terpilih yang berjalan. PP-HumanSeg (default) dan YOLO11n-seg mencakup seluruh tubuh; YuNet\nmenjaga oval lembut di tiap wajah yang ditemukannya, jadi rambut dan pakaian kena semua pass. Wajah kecil,\nmenoleh, atau tertutup bisa terlewat. Waktu CPU per mask, diukur di CPU desktop 8-core: sekitar 6 ms,\n40 ms, dan 2 ms. Perubahan memulai ulang model." },
