{ "OpenRR did not start, see the log", "OpenRR tidak mulai, lihat log" },
{ "OpenRR stopped, Ray Reconstruction goes back to FSR-RR (see the log)", "OpenRR berhenti, Ray Reconstruction kembali ke FSR-RR (lihat log)" },
{ "OpenRR stopped, see the log", "OpenRR berhenti, lihat log" },
{ "OpenRR: %s", "OpenRR: %s" },
{ "Opt-in energy guard on the floor/raw clamp: the floor may not\nexceed the raw, so the share that does is replaced with a low\npass of the raw sample. That replacement is the raw's own\nnoise, and the skip signal publishes it unfiltered - so this\nputs grain back on exactly the pixels it clamps. Averaging the\nceiling attenuates it but cannot remove it, because an average\nof the raw still carries the raw's noise. 0.0 - the default -\nleaves the floor unclamped and closes the residual instead,\nwhich removes the grain rather than reducing it. Watch\nSkipRawInject to see the pixels the clamp takes.", "Pengaman energi opt-in pada clamp floor/raw: floor tidak boleh\nmelebihi raw, jadi bagian yang melebihi diganti dengan low\npass dari sampel raw. Pengganti itu adalah noise raw\nsendiri, dan skip signal menerbitkannya tanpa filter - jadi ini\nmengembalikan grain tepat di piksel yang di-clamp. Merata-ratakan\nbatas atas melemahkannya tapi tidak bisa menghilangkannya, karena\nrata-rata dari raw tetap membawa noise raw. 0.0 - default -\nmembiarkan floor tanpa clamp dan menutup residualnya,\nyang menghilangkan grain alih-alih menguranginya. Pantau\nSkipRawInject untuk melihat piksel yang diambil clamp." },
