{ "Protect skin", "Lindungi kulit" },
{ "Proxy (what the model sees)", "Proxy (yang dilihat model)" },
{ "Proxy is the picture handed to the model -- if that looks wrong, the white point\nis wrong and nothing downstream can be judged.\n\nDifference shows what the model actually changed, amplified twenty times and\ncentred on grey. A flat grey frame there means it is doing nothing.", "Proxy adalah gambar yang diserahkan ke model -- kalau itu terlihat salah, white point-nya\nsalah dan tidak ada yang bisa dinilai setelahnya.\n\nSelisih menunjukkan apa yang benar-benar diubah model, diperkuat dua puluh kali dan\ndipusatkan di abu-abu. Frame abu-abu rata di sana berarti model tidak melakukan apa-apa." },
{ "Purple", "Ungu" },
{ "Pushes the floor filter's high-frequency luminance residual back\ninto the floor on its final pass, so texture microcontrast reaches\nthe output through the skip signal instead of the denoiser.\n0.0 restores the previous behaviour.", "Mendorong residual luminance frekuensi tinggi dari floor filter kembali\nke floor pada pass terakhirnya, jadi mikrokontras tekstur sampai ke\noutput lewat skip signal, bukan lewat denoiser.\n0.0 mengembalikan perilaku sebelumnya." },
{ "Put every %s setting on this page back to its default?", "Kembalikan semua pengaturan %s di halaman ini ke default?" },
{ "Puts the \"NR ON\" badge in a corner of the frame while Neural Rendering\nruns, so a screenshot or a video says it was on. It goes away by itself\nwhen NR is switched off, and needs no restart.", "Menaruh badge \"NR ON\" di sudut frame selama Neural Rendering\nberjalan, jadi screenshot atau video menunjukkan bahwa NR aktif. Badge hilang\nsendiri saat NR dimatikan, dan tidak perlu restart." },
{ "Puts the edited frame on the other side.\n\nWorth doing once you have decided which you prefer: the eye is not\neven-handed about left and right, and a difference can read as an\nimprovement purely from where it sits. If the same side still wins after\nswapping, it is the pass you are seeing and not the placement.", "Menaruh frame yang diedit di sisi sebaliknya.\n\nLayak dilakukan setelah Anda memutuskan mana yang lebih disukai: mata tidak\nadil soal kiri dan kanan, dan sebuah perbedaan bisa terbaca sebagai\nperbaikan hanya karena letaknya. Kalau sisi yang sama tetap menang setelah\nditukar, yang Anda lihat adalah pass-nya, bukan penempatannya." },
{ "Puts the network's change back on the game's own picture as a bounded gain, the way\nRenoDX's DLSS Neural Rendering add-on does, instead of taking the network's picture.\nHighlights the network clipped keep their range, and near-black areas are left alone.\nMost useful in HDR games. Off by default.", "Mengembalikan perubahan jaringan ke gambar asli game sebagai gain terbatas, seperti\nadd-on DLSS Neural Rendering dari RenoDX, alih-alih mengambil gambar dari jaringan.\nHighlight yang dipotong jaringan mempertahankan rentangnya, dan area hampir hitam dibiarkan.\nPaling berguna di game HDR. Off secara default." },
{ "Quality", "Quality" },
{ "Quality Preset", "Preset kualitas" },
{ "Quirks", "Quirks" },
{ "Quirks and ASI", "Quirks dan ASI" },
{ "RR 1.2 option controlling the maximum used to normalize AMD's linear-depth debug view.\nThis does not change the dispatch passthrough depth bounds.", "Opsi RR 1.2 yang mengatur maksimum untuk menormalkan tampilan debug linear-depth AMD.\nIni tidak mengubah batas depth passthrough dispatch." },
{ "RR Resource Inspector", "RR Resource Inspector" },
{ "RR specular-network output remodulated with the actual bounded,\nsurface-stabilized type-1 material split supplied to the denoiser.", "Output specular-network RR yang dimodulasi ulang dengan pemisahan material type-1\nyang sebenarnya, terbatas dan distabilkan permukaan, yang diberikan ke denoiser." },
{ "RTSS + XeFG detected", "RTSS + XeFG terdeteksi" },
{ "RTSS Reflex Injection is known to cause issues.\nEspecially when using XeFG.\nPlease disable it.", "RTSS Reflex Injection diketahui menimbulkan masalah.\nTerutama saat memakai XeFG.\nTolong nonaktifkan." },
{ "RTSS hooks every present, including the ones frame generation makes,\nand holds them back. Close RivaTuner Statistics Server (and MSI\nAfterburner, which starts it), or turn off its hooking for this game.\n\nThe FPS limit below also goes through RTSS and counts the generated\nframes: with frame generation on, cap the frame rate another way.", "RTSS meng-hook setiap present, termasuk yang dibuat frame generation,\ndan menahannya. Tutup RivaTuner Statistics Server (dan MSI\nAfterburner, yang menjalankannya), atau matikan hooking-nya untuk game ini.\n\nBatas FPS di bawah juga lewat RTSS dan menghitung frame hasil\ngenerate: dengan frame generation aktif, batasi frame rate dengan cara lain." },
{ "RX 6000", "RX 6000" },
{ "RX 6000 (experimental, FP16 network)", "RX 6000 (eksperimental, jaringan FP16)" },
{ "RX 6000 (experimental, INT8 network)", "RX 6000 (eksperimental, jaringan INT8)" },
{ "RX 7000", "RX 7000" },
{ "RX 7000 (experimental, FP16 network%s)", "RX 7000 (eksperimental, jaringan FP16%s)" },
{ "Radiance Clip Deviation", "Radiance Clip Deviation" },
{ "Raises the generated frame maximum in nvngx_dlssg.dll and in the count Streamline reports, so the ratio above offers up to 6X on pre-Blackwell cards. Patched in memory; the file on disk is not touched. Takes effect on the next game start.\n\nPacing above 2X is uneven -- the module expects Blackwell's flip metering hardware. Try DisableFlipMetering under [NvApi] alongside it.\n\nUndocumented and unsupported by NVIDIA.", "Menaikkan maksimum frame hasil generate di nvngx_dlssg.dll dan di jumlah yang dilaporkan Streamline, jadi rasio di atas menawarkan sampai 6X di kartu pra-Blackwell. Di-patch di memori; file di disk tidak disentuh. Berlaku saat game dijalankan berikutnya.\n\nPacing di atas 2X tidak rata -- modulnya mengharapkan hardware flip metering Blackwell. Coba DisableFlipMetering di bawah [NvApi] bersamanya.\n\nTidak didokumentasikan dan tidak didukung NVIDIA." },
{ "Raises the slider above to %d, which is far past what this pass\nwas built for. Expect the frame time to scale with it and the game to stop being\nplayable well before the top.\n\nCost is exactly linear and the model is nearly all of it, so ten passes is ten\nmodel runs in one frame. Each also holds an NGX feature with its own history,\nsized by the driver, and they are built one at a time with a settle between --\nreaching a large count takes a while and the frames spent building show nothing.\n\nThe ratio guard under Colour has to rise with the count or the extra passes\nspend their contribution against the clamp.", "Menaikkan slider di atas sampai %d, jauh melewati tujuan pass ini\ndibuat. Frame time akan naik mengikutinya dan game berhenti\nbisa dimainkan jauh sebelum mentok.\n\nBiayanya persis linear dan hampir semuanya adalah model, jadi sepuluh pass berarti\nsepuluh kali model jalan dalam satu frame. Masing-masing juga memegang satu fitur NGX dengan\nriwayatnya sendiri, yang ukurannya ditentukan driver, dan dibangun satu per satu dengan jeda --\nmencapai jumlah besar butuh waktu dan frame yang dipakai untuk membangun tidak menampilkan apa-apa.\n\nPengaman highlight di bawah Warna harus naik mengikuti jumlahnya, kalau tidak pass tambahan\nmenghabiskan kontribusinya melawan clamp." },
