{ "Reinhard (soft)", "Reinhard (lembut)" },
{ "Relative to RR's OUTPUT resolution: 0.50x at 4K runs NR at 1920x1080.\nRR itself remains full quality. The NR edit is resized for final composition.\nPasses 2 and 3 use the same per-pass model profiles as the SR path.", "Relatif terhadap resolusi OUTPUT RR: 0.50x di 4K menjalankan NR di 1920x1080.\nRR sendiri tetap kualitas penuh. Edit NR diubah ukurannya untuk komposisi akhir.\nPass 2 dan 3 memakai profil model per pass yang sama dengan jalur SR." },
{ "Relative to the finished frame: 1.00x runs the model over every pixel of\nit, 0.50x at 4K runs it at 1920x1080 and enlarges the answer back.\nCost falls with the square of this, so it is the first control to reach\nfor when the full-size pass is too expensive.\n\nThe AMD runtime does not supersample, so this stops at 1.00x.", "Relatif terhadap frame jadi: 1.00x menjalankan model di setiap pikselnya,\n0.50x di 4K menjalankannya di 1920x1080 dan memperbesar jawabannya kembali.\nBiaya turun mengikuti kuadratnya, jadi ini kontrol pertama yang perlu\ndiraih saat pass ukuran penuh terlalu mahal.\n\nRuntime AMD tidak melakukan supersampling, jadi ini berhenti di 1.00x." },
{ "Relax resolution checks for HUDless by 32 pixels \nHelps games which use black borders for some \nresolutions and screen ratios (e.g. Witcher 3)", "Longgarkan cek resolusi HUDless sebesar 32 piksel \nMembantu game yang memakai border hitam di beberapa \nresolusi dan rasio layar (mis. Witcher 3)" },
{ "Relaxed Resource Check", "Cek resource longgar" },
{ "Releases the floor's luminance edge stop where diffuse albedo says\ntwo taps share a material, so shadows and reflections reach the\ndenoiser instead of being captured into the floor and returned\nblurred. 0.0 restores the previous behaviour.", "Melepas penahan tepi luminance floor di tempat diffuse albedo menunjukkan\ndua tap berbagi satu material, jadi bayangan dan pantulan sampai ke\ndenoiser, bukan tertangkap ke floor dan dikembalikan\nblur. 0.0 mengembalikan perilaku sebelumnya." },
{ "Remembers what was around the camera in previous frames\nand uses it to fill the screen edges and the area under your hands.\nEdge fill mode is only used where the cache has nothing.\nShown with a blue tint in debug mode", "Mengingat apa yang ada di sekitar kamera pada frame sebelumnya\ndan memakainya untuk mengisi tepi layar dan area di bawah tangan Anda.\nMode isian tepi hanya dipakai di tempat cache kosong.\nDitampilkan dengan tint biru di mode debug" },
