{ "Reprojection", "Reprojection" },
{ "Reprojection (WIP)", "Reprojection (WIP)" },
{ "Reprojection Settings", "Pengaturan reprojection" },
{ "Reprojection would swing the character around with the camera,\nso it gets paused while something in the middle of the screen follows the camera.\nUses the game's motion vectors and the cache parallax scale.\nVehicle cockpits can count as 3rd person too.\nDisable to keep reprojection always active", "Reprojection akan mengayun karakter mengikuti kamera,\njadi ia dijeda selama sesuatu di tengah layar mengikuti kamera.\nMemakai motion vector game dan skala paralaks cache.\nKokpit kendaraan juga bisa terhitung orang ke-3.\nNonaktifkan supaya reprojection selalu aktif" },
{ "Reprojects the game image using new mouse data\nKinda like Reflex 2, perceived latency improvement\n\n- REQUIRES DLSSG VIA STREAMLINE AS INPUT\n- Only works with first person perspective games\n- Only mouse, no controller\n- If possible, disable any mouse/camera smoothing in the game\n", "Mem-reproject gambar game dengan data mouse baru\nMirip Reflex 2, latensi terasa lebih baik\n\n- BUTUH DLSSG VIA STREAMLINE SEBAGAI INPUT\n- Hanya untuk game sudut pandang orang pertama\n- Hanya mouse, tanpa controller\n- Kalau bisa, nonaktifkan smoothing mouse/kamera di game\n" },
{ "Required for Debug flags to work correctly", "Diperlukan agar flag Debug bekerja dengan benar" },
{ "Requires Nukem's dlssg_to_fsr3 dll", "Butuh dll dlssg_to_fsr3 dari Nukem" },
{ "Requires an upscaler, or NR without upscaling with XeFG\n\nCan be used with any FG Output, but might be imperfect with some\nTo prevent UI glitching, HUDfix required", "Butuh upscaler, atau NR tanpa upscaling dengan XeFG\n\nBisa dipakai dengan Output FG apa pun, tapi mungkin kurang sempurna dengan sebagian\nUntuk mencegah glitch UI, HUDfix diperlukan" },
