{ "Set by XeFG: the game's own keeps its XeLL (only the FPS limit is OptiScaler's)", "Diatur XeFG: milik game mempertahankan XeLL-nya (hanya batas FPS yang milik OptiScaler)" },
{ "Sets ApplyAfterRR to false; danielblnc then runs before Super Resolution / Ray\nReconstruction too, if you switch back to it.", "Mengatur ApplyAfterRR ke false; danielblnc lalu berjalan sebelum Super Resolution / Ray\nReconstruction juga, kalau Anda kembali memakainya." },
