{ "Such an aggressive upscaling? A bold move", "Upscaling seagresif itu? Langkah berani" },
{ "Supersampling %.2fx: the model runs ABOVE native, then\nis sampled back down. Experimental, and costly -- time grows with the area.", "Supersampling %.2fx: model berjalan DI ATAS native, lalu\ndi-sample turun kembali. Eksperimental, dan mahal -- waktu naik mengikuti luas." },
