{ "Sync Int.", "Sync Int." },
{ "Syncing Settings", "Pengaturan sync" },
{ "Synthesises detail in the upscaler's frame, before frame generation sees it.\n\nNeeds two similarly named files beside OptiScaler, one character apart:\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA's model (~165 MB) -- you supply it\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   the forwarder (~13 KB) -- ships in this package\nUndocumented and driven directly, so none of this is officially supported.", "Mensintesis detail di frame upscaler, sebelum frame generation melihatnya.\n\nButuh dua file bernama mirip di samping OptiScaler, beda satu karakter:\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       model NVIDIA (~165 MB) -- Anda yang menyediakan\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   forwarder (~13 KB) -- disertakan di paket ini\nTidak didokumentasikan dan dikendalikan langsung, jadi tidak ada yang didukung resmi." },
{ "System", "Sistem" },
{ "Take the upscaler inputs from this API", "Ambil input upscaler dari API ini" },
{ "Takes off the brightening the network adds in near-black areas, so blacks stay black.", "Membuang pencerahan yang ditambahkan jaringan di area hampir hitam, jadi hitam tetap hitam." },
{ "Takes the game's GBuffer.SpecularMvec for how reflections move, as DLSS-RR does,\ninstead of deriving it from depth, normals and the hit distance.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether reflections smear or lag.", "Memakai GBuffer.SpecularMvec game untuk gerak pantulan, seperti DLSS-RR,\nalih-alih menurunkannya dari depth, normal, dan jarak hit.\nDiagnostik: matikan untuk melihat apakah pantulan jadi smear atau tertinggal." },
{ "Takes the transparency layer's own opacity and motion vectors when the game gives them, as DLSS-RR does.\nDiagnostic: turn it off to see whether particles or transparent effects change.", "Memakai opacity dan motion vector milik layer transparansi bila game memberikannya, seperti DLSS-RR.\nDiagnostik: matikan untuk melihat apakah partikel atau efek transparan berubah." },
