{ "Thanks nitec, back to you nitec", "Terima kasih nitec, kembali ke Anda nitec" },
{ "That's likely unintended and will lead to big OptiScaler.log\nPlease disable logging to file and delete OptiScaler.log", "Itu kemungkinan tidak disengaja dan akan membuat OptiScaler.log besar\nTolong nonaktifkan logging ke file dan hapus OptiScaler.log" },
{ "The FG that you will actually be using", "FG yang benar-benar akan Anda pakai" },
{ "The GPU's own: AntiLag 2 on AMD, Reflex on Nvidia, LatencyFlex otherwise", "Milik GPU: AntiLag 2 di AMD, Reflex di Nvidia, selain itu LatencyFlex" },
{ "The GPU's own: AntiLag 2 on AMD, Reflex on Nvidia, XeLL on Intel, LatencyFlex otherwise", "Milik GPU: AntiLag 2 di AMD, Reflex di Nvidia, XeLL di Intel, selain itu LatencyFlex" },
{ "The GPU's own: AntiLag on AMD, Reflex on Nvidia, LatencyFlex otherwise", "Milik GPU: AntiLag di AMD, Reflex di Nvidia, selain itu LatencyFlex" },
{ "The OpenNR installer on GitHub", "Installer OpenNR di GitHub" },
{ "The RX 6000 has neither FP8 nor matrix units, so this runs the RX 7000's FP16\nnetwork with its matrices worked out in ordinary FP16 dot products: much slower\nthan on an RX 9000 or RX 7000, and about 2 GB more VRAM at 1080p. Every pipeline\nwas compiled once apart from the game before the first build.\nExperimental: if the picture looks wrong or the game stutters, turn NR off and report it.", "RX 6000 tidak punya FP8 maupun unit matriks, jadi ini menjalankan jaringan FP16\nmilik RX 7000 dengan matriksnya dihitung lewat dot product FP16 biasa: jauh lebih lambat\ndaripada di RX 9000 atau RX 7000, dan sekitar 2 GB VRAM lebih banyak di 1080p. Setiap pipeline\ndi-compile sekali terpisah dari game sebelum build pertama.\nEksperimental: kalau gambarnya terlihat salah atau game stutter, matikan NR dan laporkan." },
{ "The RX 6000 has neither FP8 nor matrix units, so this runs the RX 7000's network\nwith most of its matrices worked out in 8-bit integer dot products: about a tenth faster\nthan its FP16 form, still much slower than on an RX 9000 or RX 7000. The FP16 form is\nunder Performance and advanced.\nExperimental: if the picture looks wrong or the game stutters, turn NR off and report it.", "RX 6000 tidak punya FP8 maupun unit matriks, jadi di sini berjalan jaringan RX 7000\ndengan sebagian besar matriksnya dihitung lewat perkalian titik bilangan bulat 8-bit: sekitar sepersepuluh\nlebih cepat dari bentuk FP16-nya, tapi tetap jauh lebih lambat daripada di RX 9000 atau RX 7000. Bentuk FP16 ada\ndi Performa dan lanjutan.\nEksperimental: jika gambar terlihat salah atau game tersendat, matikan NR dan laporkan." },
{ "The RX 7000 has no FP8, so this runs mauri870's port of the network to FP16\nmatrices: slower than on an RX 9000, and about 2 GB more VRAM at 1080p. The GPU's\nmatrix layout and every pipeline were checked before the first build.\nExperimental: if the picture looks wrong, turn NR off and report it.", "RX 7000 tidak punya FP8, jadi ini menjalankan port jaringan ke matriks FP16\nbuatan mauri870: lebih lambat daripada di RX 9000, dan sekitar 2 GB VRAM lebih banyak di 1080p.\nLayout matriks GPU dan setiap pipeline diperiksa sebelum build pertama.\nEksperimental: kalau gambarnya terlihat salah, matikan NR dan laporkan." },
{ "The Way It's Meant To Be Upscaled", "The Way It's Meant To Be Upscaled" },
{ "The best input the game sends: Reflex, XeLL when enabled in the game, AntiLag 2, UE, XeLL.\nAntiLag 2 first while the game's FSR-FG reports its frames through it.\nWithout any, OptiScaler's own with the DLSSG output.", "Input terbaik yang dikirim game: Reflex, XeLL bila diaktifkan di game, AntiLag 2, UE, XeLL.\nAntiLag 2 lebih dulu selama FSR-FG game melaporkan frame-nya lewat itu.\nTanpa satu pun, milik OptiScaler sendiri dengan output DLSSG." },
{ "The brightness the network sees the frame at. Game uses the exposure the game\nhands over; Auto measures it from the frame. If the picture turns green, grainy,\ntoo dark or too bright, try the other one.", "Kecerahan saat jaringan melihat gambar. Game memakai eksposur yang\ndiberikan game; Auto mengukurnya dari gambar. Jika gambar jadi hijau, berbintik,\nterlalu gelap atau terlalu terang, coba yang lain." },
{ "The current NGX parameter table cannot be safely enumerated.", "Tabel parameter NGX saat ini tidak bisa dienumerasi dengan aman." },
{ "The data source to be used for FG\nThe native FG which the game supports", "Sumber data yang dipakai untuk FG\nFG native yang didukung game" },
{ "The display curve the network sees the frame through. Changing it\nrestarts the model's history.\n\nNeeds the danielblnc runtime 0.4.0 or later.", "Kurva display yang dipakai jaringan untuk melihat frame. Mengubahnya\nmemulai ulang riwayat model.\n\nButuh runtime danielblnc 0.4.0 atau lebih baru." },
{ "The filter that averages the model's above-native answer back to display size --\nthis is what turns supersampling into LESS noise rather than more. Sharper\nfilters (Lanczos3, Kaiser3) keep the most detail; softer ones (Bicubic,\nCatmull-Rom) are gentler on ringing. Independent of the Output Scaling\ndownscaler, so the two can differ and run at the same time.", "Filter yang merata-ratakan jawaban model yang di atas native kembali ke ukuran display --\ninilah yang membuat supersampling menghasilkan noise LEBIH SEDIKIT, bukan lebih banyak. Filter\nlebih tajam (Lanczos3, Kaiser3) menjaga detail paling banyak; yang lebih lembut (Bicubic,\nCatmull-Rom) lebih ramah soal ringing. Terpisah dari downscaler Output\nScaling, jadi keduanya bisa berbeda dan berjalan bersamaan." },
{ "The game doesn't send it", "Game tidak mengirimnya" },
{ "The game's DLSS-FG is running; set it in the game", "DLSS-FG milik game sedang berjalan; atur di game" },
{ "The game's motion vectors (DXGI format %u) are not supported: running\nwithout history.", "Motion vector game (format DXGI %u) tidak didukung: berjalan\ntanpa riwayat." },
{ "The game's own exposure", "Exposure milik game" },
{ "The highest multiplier Dynamic MFG may use", "Pengali tertinggi yang boleh dipakai MFG dinamis" },
{ "The illusion of performance", "Ilusi performa" },
{ "The largest colour change the composition lets through, in stops. The brightness change\nis held by the highlight guard.", "Perubahan warna terbesar yang diloloskan komposisi, dalam stop. Perubahan kecerahan\nditahan oleh pengaman highlight." },
{ "The model is handed the finished frame, and the percentage below is of\nthat frame: at 50% a 4K picture is reduced to 1080p, the model runs on\nit, and its answer is enlarged back to fill the frame.", "Model diberi frame jadi, dan persentase di bawah adalah dari\nframe itu: di 50%, gambar 4K dikecilkan ke 1080p, model berjalan di\nsitu, dan jawabannya diperbesar kembali untuk mengisi frame." },
{ "The model is handed the render-resolution frame the upscaler is about to\nread, so the percentage below is of that render resolution. The upscaler\nthen enlarges the model\'s work along with everything else.", "Model diberi frame resolusi render yang akan dibaca upscaler,\njadi persentase di bawah adalah dari resolusi render itu. Upscaler\nlalu memperbesar hasil kerja model bersama yang lain." },
{ "The model was trained on finished, sRGB-encoded frames. The upscaler's\noutput is not one: it is linear and open-ended. These decide how it is\nmapped into something the model recognises. A frame the game reports as\nalready tone-mapped is passed over untouched and none of this applies.", "Model dilatih dengan frame jadi yang ter-encode sRGB. Output\nupscaler bukan seperti itu: ia linear dan tak berbatas. Ini menentukan cara ia\ndipetakan menjadi sesuatu yang dikenali model. Frame yang dilaporkan game\nsudah di-tone-map dilewatkan tanpa disentuh dan semua ini tidak berlaku." },
{ "The model's own processing profiles. Standard is NVIDIA's default; Natural is\nthe one lmxxf's kernels had built in before. Changing it rebuilds the model,\na pause of a second or two.", "Profil pemrosesan milik model. Standar adalah default NVIDIA; Natural adalah\nyang sebelumnya tertanam di kernel lmxxf. Mengubahnya membangun ulang model,\njeda satu atau dua detik." },
{ "The more you upscaler, the more you save", "Makin banyak upscale, makin banyak hemat" },
{ "The most the composition may brighten or darken a pixel, as a multiple of what it was.\nOne number from the brightness, applied to the whole colour, so it bounds light without\ntouching hue. 2.0x by default; raise it only if bright areas look held back.", "Batas terbesar komposisi boleh mencerahkan atau menggelapkan piksel, sebagai kelipatan dari nilai asalnya.\nSatu angka dari kecerahan, diterapkan ke seluruh warna, jadi ia membatasi cahaya tanpa\nmenyentuh hue. Default 2.0x; naikkan hanya kalau area terang terlihat tertahan." },
{ "The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in\nboth directions -- a pixel may not be brightened past this nor darkened past\nits reciprocal. Lights are where the model has least to say and rescaling its\nanswer does the most damage; 2x leaves detail intact while stopping a strip\nlight turning into a string of coloured cells. Raise it only if bright areas\nlook clipped.", "Batas terbesar pass boleh menggeser piksel mana pun, sebagai kelipatan dari nilai asalnya, ke\ndua arah -- piksel tidak boleh dicerahkan melewati ini atau digelapkan melewati\nkebalikannya. Lampu adalah tempat model paling sedikit berkontribusi dan menskalakan ulang\njawabannya paling merusak; 2x menjaga detail tetap utuh sambil mencegah lampu\nstrip berubah jadi deretan sel berwarna. Naikkan hanya kalau area terang\nterlihat terpotong." },
{ "The network NR runs, by its name in NVIDIA's DLL, as mochizuki's NR Control lists them.\nCC_SMALL_FP8: the model of 310.9.16, the default and fastest.\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL: that model made faster by mochizuki; its picture differs somewhat.\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD: the model of 310.8.\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED: the 310.8 model made faster by mochizuki, its picture very close.\nThe two faster ones need ACO on an RX 9000; their weights are made from the installed model the\nfirst time. Switching builds the other network in a few seconds while the current one keeps\nrunning; no restart.", "Jaringan yang dijalankan NR, menurut namanya di DLL NVIDIA, seperti yang didaftar NR Control mochizuki.\nCC_SMALL_FP8: model dari 310.9.16, default dan tercepat.\nCC_SMALL_FP8_EXPERIMENTAL: model itu yang dipercepat mochizuki; gambarnya agak berbeda.\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD: model dari 310.8.\nCC_SILVER_AARDWOLD_OPTIMIZED: model 310.8 yang dipercepat mochizuki, gambarnya sangat dekat.\nDua yang lebih cepat butuh ACO di RX 9000; weight-nya dibuat dari model terpasang saat\npertama kali. Menggantinya membangun jaringan lain dalam beberapa detik sementara yang sekarang\ntetap berjalan; tanpa restart." },
{ "The network also reads its own result from the previous frame, moved along the\ngame's motion vectors. Keeps the effect steadier in motion. Off runs every frame\non its own.", "Jaringan juga membaca hasilnya sendiri dari frame sebelumnya, digeser mengikuti\nmotion vector game. Membuat efek lebih stabil saat bergerak. Off menjalankan tiap frame\nsendiri-sendiri." },
{ "The network runs on a smaller copy of the frame: full resolution in the centre, lower toward\nthe edges, and its change is put back on the full frame, so the game's own detail stays\neverywhere and only the effect gets softer at the sides. NR pixels at 16:9: about 80% light,\n70% medium, 45-50% strong. Each change rebuilds the network and restarts its history.\nBefore the upscaler it runs with mochizuki only (the render frame is warped, the upscaler\nkeeps its jitter); off while person protection runs.\nCustom takes FoveationCentreWidth/Height, FoveationFalloff and FoveationEdge from the INI.", "Jaringan berjalan di salinan frame yang lebih kecil: resolusi penuh di tengah, lebih rendah ke arah\ntepi, dan perubahannya dikembalikan ke frame penuh, jadi detail asli game tetap ada di\nmana-mana dan hanya efeknya yang melembut di sisi. Piksel NR di 16:9: sekitar 80% (ringan),\n70% (sedang), 45-50% (kuat). Tiap perubahan membangun ulang jaringan dan memulai ulang riwayatnya.\nSebelum upscaler ia hanya berjalan dengan mochizuki (frame render di-warp, upscaler\nmempertahankan jitter-nya); off selama proteksi orang berjalan.\nKustom mengambil FoveationCentreWidth/Height, FoveationFalloff, dan FoveationEdge dari INI." },
{ "The network's history in RGBA16F, as NVIDIA's DLL keeps it (half the memory). Off keeps\nRGBA32F, the picture before. An RX 9000 with ACO off keeps 32-bit. Rebuilds the network.", "Riwayat jaringan dalam RGBA16F, seperti yang disimpan DLL NVIDIA (setengah memori). Off mempertahankan\nRGBA32F, gambar yang sebelumnya. RX 9000 dengan ACO off tetap 32-bit. Membangun ulang jaringan." },
{ "The number runs the other way", "Angkanya berjalan ke arah sebaliknya" },
{ "The resource inspector is off. Enable it in the FSR-RR page.", "Resource inspector off. Aktifkan di halaman FSR-RR." },
{ "The safest, but might not reduce latency well", "Paling aman, tapi mungkin kurang menurunkan latensi" },
{ "The same frame twice: without OptiScaler's overlays, and as shown with the menu on it,\nnamed \"... (menu).png\".", "Frame yang sama dua kali: tanpa overlay OptiScaler, dan seperti yang tampil dengan menu di atasnya,\nbernama \"... (menu).png\"." },
{ "The size YuNet sees the whole frame at. Larger finds smaller faces and costs more CPU time.\n320 by default.", "Ukuran seluruh frame seperti yang dilihat YuNet. Lebih besar menemukan wajah lebih kecil dan butuh waktu CPU lebih banyak.\nDefault 320." },
{ "The weight of the network's change. 0 is the game's own picture, 1 the change as the\nnetwork made it. Above 1 the brightness change is pushed further, still inside the\nhighlight guard, and the colour change stays as it was.", "Bobot perubahan jaringan. 0 adalah gambar asli game, 1 perubahan seperti yang\ndibuat jaringan. Di atas 1 perubahan kecerahan didorong lebih jauh, tetap di dalam\npengaman highlight, dan perubahan warna tetap seperti semula." },
{ "The white point for the selected calibration point, or -- with no row\nselected -- the value the next Anchor press captures.\n\nSet it until the picture looks right here, then Anchor. Move to very\ndifferent light and do it again: two points fix the buffer's real\nrelationship and the white point holds between them. Click a row below\nto come back and adjust that point; click it again to let go.", "White point untuk titik kalibrasi terpilih, atau -- bila tidak ada baris\nterpilih -- nilai yang direkam tekanan Anchor berikutnya.\n\nAtur sampai gambar terlihat benar di sini, lalu Anchor. Pindah ke cahaya yang\nsangat berbeda dan ulangi: dua titik menetapkan hubungan asli\nbuffer dan white point bertahan di antara keduanya. Klik baris di bawah\nuntuk kembali dan menyetel titik itu; klik lagi untuk melepasnya." },
{ "The whole pass: the staging copies and the resolve as well as the\nmodel. Timing only the model would flatter the number.\n\nCompare it against the frame time at the bottom of this window to\nsee what it is costing you.", "Seluruh pass: salinan staging dan resolve, selain\nmodel. Mengukur model saja akan mempercantik angkanya.\n\nBandingkan dengan frame time di bagian bawah jendela ini untuk\nmelihat berapa biayanya bagi Anda." },
{ "These hints are passed to NVIDIA at creation, but their visual effect is unverified. Use Style for model profile selection. Existing INI hints are preserved.", "Hint ini diteruskan ke NVIDIA saat pembuatan, tapi efek visualnya belum terverifikasi. Pakai Gaya untuk memilih profil model. Hint INI yang sudah ada dipertahankan." },
{ "This MochizukiNrRuntime.dll runs the network outside the RenoDX\nstage, so the settings above do not reach it: update it.", "MochizukiNrRuntime.dll ini menjalankan jaringan di luar tahap\nRenoDX, jadi pengaturan di atas tidak sampai ke sana: perbarui." },
{ "This OpenRR runtime does not have the New mode.", "Runtime OpenRR ini tidak punya mode Baru." },
{ "This game has an upscaler, and NR runs inside it. NR without upscaling still sets XeFG's\nmotion vector options for frame generation; turn it off for this game.", "Game ini punya upscaler, dan NR berjalan di dalamnya. NR tanpa upscaling tetap mengatur opsi\nmotion vector XeFG untuk frame generation; matikan untuk game ini." },
{ "This game supplies an exposure -- the option above would use it.", "Game ini menyediakan exposure -- opsi di atas akan memakainya." },
{ "This game supplies an exposure and it is being read.", "Game ini menyediakan exposure dan sedang dibaca." },
{ "This game supplies no exposure -- paper white is in use. Try the scan instead.", "Game ini tidak menyediakan exposure -- paper white sedang dipakai. Coba scan saja." },
{ "This is where the fun begins...", "Di sinilah keseruannya dimulai..." },
